1. **Duplicate processing** — `job_queue.py:16` had an `await asyncio.sleep(0.01)` between finding a pending job and setting its status to "processing". This yielded control to the event loop, allowing all 5 workers to see the same pending job before any claimed it. Fixed by removing the yield.

